{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32531","headline":"且可怜行 · 刘驾","name":"且可怜行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"园中花自早，不信外无花。\n良人未朝去，先出登香车。\n□□五□轮，满城闻呕哑。\n侍儿衣各别，头上金雀多。\n祗是一家人，路人疑千家。\n过後香满陌，直到春日斜。\n今朝且可怜，莫问久如何。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32531.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32531","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}